  "_doc": "#2321: which rsi `e2e_tui` modules drive which crates/rsi/src surfaces. scripts/check-touched-shards reads this at the candidate head and, for each changed path matching a surface, suggests `rsi=test:e2e_tui:test(<module>::)` (only that module's tests, not the whole target). Globs: `*` stays inside one path segment, `**` crosses directories. Add a surface here when an e2e_tui module starts driving a new TUI file; modules not mounted in crates/rsi/tests/e2e_tui.rs are dropped and reported.",
